### Active-dose and ppm ledger

`Active µL proxy = raw µL x declared stock fraction.`  
`Concentrate ppm = active µL proxy / 7,500 µL x 1,000,000.`  
`Finished ppm = active µL proxy / 30,000 µL x 1,000,000.`

These are nominal volume-equivalent screening values, not exact w/w release values. Exact mass ppm remains unavailable until the Ambrox stock density and the Ethyl Safranate/Ethyl Maltol stock bases are bound.

| Material | Stock fraction | Raw µL | Active µL proxy | Concentrate ppm | Finished ppm | ODT/OAV authority |
